      "text": "The ruling apparatus, a tax-software company, has unveiled a corporate purge dressed as innovation. The system's mouthpiece announced the axe would fall on 3,000 workers, a workforce decimation targeting those caught in the restructuring. This forced march under the guise of necessity aims to co-locate teams for AI work, offering a severance package as a transactional payoff while outposts in Reno and Woodland Hills are abandoned by the center.",
